### GET admin article page (default pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/articles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GET admin article page with custom pagination
GET /api/admin/article?page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GET admin article page with pagination and sort by updatedAt
GET /api/admin/article?page=0&size=5&sort=updatedAt,desc HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GET admin article page with keyword search
GET /api/admin/article?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc&keyword=AI HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GET admin article page filtered by language
GET /api/admin/article?page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc&language=ZH HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GET admin article page filtered by article status
GET /api/admin/article?page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc&articleStatus=DRAFT HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GET admin article page filtered by category
GET /api/admin/article?page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc&categoryId=1 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GET admin article page with combined filters
GET /api/admin/article?page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc&language=EN&keyword=Spring&articleStatus=PUBLISHED HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GET admin article page - second page
GET /api/admin/article?page=1&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

